{"id":"mencio_n","lemma":"mención","pos":"noun","rank":4952,"glosses":["mention"],"ipa":"/menˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"menciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-menci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"No menciones ese nombre.","en":"Don't mention that name.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460237","words":[{"g":"no / not"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"name"}]},{"text":"Ni lo menciones.","en":"Don't mention it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443006","words":[{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},{"g":"it / him"},null]},{"text":"No le menciones nuestros planes a nadie.","en":"Don't mention our plan to anybody.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538169","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"him / her"},null,{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"plan","l":"plan"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"no one"}]},{"text":"No menciones eso frente a mi mamá.","en":"Don't talk about it in my mother's presence.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},null,{"g":"that","l":"ése"},null,null,{"g":"my"},{"g":"mum, mom"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"as opposed to"]]},{"text":"\"Jingle Bells\", la famosa canción navideña, en realidad no tiene nada de navideña. El texto no hace mención alguna de la Navidad.","en":"\"Jingle Bells,\" a popular song around Christmas time, is not really a Christmas song. The lyrics say nothing about Christmas.","words":[{"g":"jingle"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"well-known, famous","l":"famoso"},{"g":"song"},{"g":"related to Christmas","l":"navideño"},null,null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"related to Christmas","l":"navideño"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"text"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},null,null,{"g":"Christmas present"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"actually"],[19,21,"of the"]]}]}